### Create Vector Index (Manual Step)

Spring AI `1.0.0-M6` doesn’t auto-create the vector index, so run this in MongoDB Shell or Atlas UI:

```javascript
db.java_vector_team_a.createSearchIndex({
    "name": "vector_index",
    "definition": {
        "fields": [
            {
                "type": "vector",
                "path": "embedding",
                "numDimensions": 1536,
                "similarity": "dotProduct"
            }
        ]
    }
})
```

- Run this **after** creating embeddings the first time, as the collection must exist.

